38. Functions of the Council 
The functions of the Council shall be to work with other relevant Government agencies and the private
sector to—
(a) advise on, and enforce accessibility, reasonable accommodation, non-discrimination for persons
with disabilities and with regard to information, goods, services and the built environment and
their participation in society on an equal basis with others;
